Z||000000||2xsess||07-29-2001||06:21 PM||||Well, I'm still alive and kicking. A little sick of seeing the same old stuff everyday but otherwise none the worse for wear.<BR>I came in for the first time in a few weeks to see what's been going on. It's good to see that all is the same. Aus is still kicking a$$ with those great designs! And everyone else is their same old selves.<P>Well, take care all of you,<BR>Jeff<BR>Somewhere in the middle of nowhere in Kosovo!<P>P.S. god do I miss my Fiero!!||||reg||1
